	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literę, quas ad nos dedisti 7. maii<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> (oben <ref target="file11311">Nr. 1268</ref>) und wohl auch jener an <persName ref="p5046">Grynäus</persName> (oben <ref target="file11310">Nr. 1267</ref>).</note>, inventę sunt tandem casu 6. iunii in ędibus d. <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p1365">Grynęi</persName>; hic enim dum chartulam dilaceravit, ex ea literę ceciderunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quocirca non <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mirare, quod ad eas nec responsum est nec doctoris <persName ref="p8049">Vadiani</persName> epistola<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Siehe oben <ref target="file11310">Nr. 1267</ref>, 3-5 mit Anm. 2.</note> remissa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De conventu <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l361">Norinbergensi</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> hatte seinen Unmut über das in <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt</placeName> beschlossene Religionsgespräch zum Ausdruck gebracht; s. oben <ref target="file11310">Nr. 1267</ref>, 9-13; 1268, 13-34.</note> principio, dum audirem, fortiter perturbabar; in mentem enim veniebant multa <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et varia, in primis autem, quod audiveram arbitros nescio quos adhibendos a <persName ref="p18538">cę<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sare</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> et <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName>, qui disceptationis deberent esse pacificatores.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Accedebat querimonia <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quorundam etiam, qui in legatione <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiensi</placeName> agebant, quibus valde dolebat in<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>diligentia, qua quidem egerant, quicquid est domini<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. etwa <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Kritik an <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> und <persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich von Sachsen</persName> in seinem Brief an <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName> vom 30. April (<bibl source="b51">Blarer BW</bibl> II 23f).</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ut autem hic dolor, ita gaudium in <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Christi clementia, qui non hominum negligentiam, sed causam suam respiciens rem ad articulos, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quos nosti<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Gemeint ist der <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Anstand vom 19. April; vgl. oben <ref target="file11316">Nr. 1273</ref>, 19-21.</note>, perduxerat, quamvis et hic non aliter satisfactum, quam dum, quod evenit, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aequi consulere cogimur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In illis autem articulis, maxime tamen quę pertinent ad co<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nventum, principibus sequestribus multum certe permissum est, quod <persName ref="p18520">Ioachimus</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p18520">Joachim II.</persName>, Kurfürst von Brandenburg.</note> ad evangelium totus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>procumberet, <persName ref="p18548">Palatinus</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18548">Ludwig V.</persName>, Kurfürst von der Pfalz.</note> accederet in dies magis ac magis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">In conventu putabant<pb type="edition" next="153"/> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>illud futurum, ut, qualitercunque res caderet, a nobis staret ęquitas; nam si hunc <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>eluserint, habetur causa, quare nec concilium liberum ferre possint hostes; si quid praevaricabuntur <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>praesentes, erunt iterum manifesti.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si, ut pactum est, successerit, spes erit causam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dei melius audituram apud multos ex adversariorum numero, etiamsi reliqui <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vehementius furore movebuntur et persequutionem instituent crudelissimam; tunc tandem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>enim illud fiet, quod Christus vere fidelibus suis promisit<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. etwa <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10, 17-25</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>24, 3-14.</ref></cit></note>, et dabit procul dubio constantiam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et perseverantiam in finem usque<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10, 22</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>24, 13.</ref></cit></note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Multo autem corda piorum reddentur solidiora, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quicquid accidat, postquam apud hostes omnia fecerunt, quę decuit, ad eos domino communi <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>lucrifaciendos, tametsi frus[tra]<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Rand beschädigt.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Adde, quod et illud consideratum est valde diligenter, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quanam difficultate extrema illa possint copulari, quibus nihil esse potest magis seiunctum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Vocamus nos papam antichristum et omnes eius fautores antichristi servos; <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ille contra nos vocat hęreticos et schismaticos et desertores ecclesię.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Qualis, quaeso, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>copula fuerit, qua tam separata, imo vero tam contraria possint coniungi?</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Di<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>co libere: Non erit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scimus papam non relicturum suum locum; scimus nostros non ces<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>suros de sententia salutis.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Ad quid igitur conventus?</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ut, quę libris hactenus frustra <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>contendentibus in lucem sunt edita, coram audiantur, discutiantur, ventilentur et cogant <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>adversarios tueri sua contra veritatem et conscientiam vel cedere, tum ut mundus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>sciat, quam veritas lucem non timeat<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh3,21</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Constat enim, quam hactenus male audiverimus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>de fuga concilii.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Hęc igitur postquam audivi<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> lehnt sich an Überlegungen <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> an; vgl. dessen undatierten Brief an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> und <persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> in Zürich ZB, Ms F 80, 140, aber auch das oben Anm. 5 erwähnte Schreiben.</note> et pro mea tenuitate consideravi, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>perturbatio sic imminuta est, ut cum multis timere incipiam, ne veniant hostes <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l361">Norinbergam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Nescio, quę me spes teneat, ubi inter se partes mentes aperuerint, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nobis omnia feliciora futura, sive persequutionem ferre compellamur sive pacem in <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>veritate consequamur.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Ita quidem hęc apud te effundo, qualiter video te quoque fecisse, [nam?]<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Rand beschädigt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>domino magna illa committo; servabit is suos, quicquid nos interim per negligentiam deper<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>damus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Reliqua sunt: <persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> non gratum fecit mihi, quod <persName ref="p4349">Carolostadio</persName> scripsit<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> hatte zwar am 26. Mai in einem Brief an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> angekündigt, <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadt</persName> ermahnen zu wollen (s. Zürich StA, E II 340, 142), doch verzichtete er auf Rat von Freunden darauf (s. ebd., 124).</note>; <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>nam in immensum gravius reddit odium viri contra me.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Suspicatur enim me <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>excitasse.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Quicquid fit contra ipsum, ex me suspicatur exiisse.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Dum mecum est, bla[n]dus<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Rand beschädigt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>est, ridet, veneratur; dum abest, mirum quam me graviter accuset, in primis <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>velim sese eiectum.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Apud te ista loquor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Tu quę doces, quibus consolaris et fortem <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>facis<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> bezieht sich auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> eingangs erwähnten Brief.</note>, scias esse mihi gratissima<pb type="edition" next="154"/> et iucundissima, imo et latura, dum tempus er[it]<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Rand beschädigt.</hi></note>, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>utilitatem.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Reddidimus semel rationem, quur pugnemus contra positas leges<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Gemeint sind die neuen Universitätsstatuten; s. oben <ref target="file11307">Nr. 1264</ref>, 1-7.</note>, domin[is]<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>Rand beschädigt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>et universitatis delectui<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">d. h. dem Rat und der Regenz.</note>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Petierunt, ut descriptum responsum sibi offeramus; morem <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>gessimus<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Vgl. unten Z. 63-66.</note>.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Nunc igitur cogitant, consultant, disputant, scribunt et tueri conantur, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>quod tamen condidisse se negarunt palam, nempe leges.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Quales tu iudicas eiusm<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>odi homines esse?</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">De his plura, postquam videbimus, qualibus armis sua sint defensuri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z49"/>De <persName ref="p19058">Georgio</persName> duce<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Herzog <persName ref="p19058">Georg von Sachsen</persName>.</note> rogavi nuper tabellionem<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Unbekannt.</note>, qui venerat in ędes meas, <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>a principe suo<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Graf <persName ref="p8098">Georg von Württemberg-Mömpelgard</persName>; vgl. oben <ref target="file11316">Nr. 1273</ref>, 33-35.</note> missus, omnia, quae ad te scripsi<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Ebd., Z. 21-33.</note>.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Nihil non adseruit hoc adiecto<pb type="scan" next="191v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>principem suum ex ingenti gaudio timere, ne res sic evenerit, et magnam partem <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>scholę Witenbergensis iam translatam esse <placeName ref="l284">Lipsiam</placeName><note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Ein unzutreffendes Gerücht.</note> ac omnia habere feliciter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Fratri <persName ref="p1998">Ioanni</persName><note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24"><persName ref="p1998">Johannes Lüthard</persName> (<persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> nennt ihn auch "frater Ioannes minorita", s. Zürich StA, E II 343, 160).</note> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ad describendum dedi, quę magistris nostris obtulimus<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Die undatierte Stellungnahme der Theologen gegen die neuen Universitätsstatuten ist nur in Abschrift überliefert (<placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> UB, Ms. Ki. Ar. 23a, 175r.-177v.); <persName ref="p1998">Lüthards</persName> Kopie scheint verloren zu sein. Zum Inhalt vgl. <bibl source="b147">Burckhardt-Biedermann</bibl> 469f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Excerpta sunt ex scripto longissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>quod congessimus, ut, si foret opus, senatus haberet, qua ratione defendere nostra <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>possemus.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Is narrabit ploeno ore<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">Zu <persName ref="p1998">Lüthards</persName> Besuch in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> vgl. <bibl source="b482">Pellikan, Chronikon</bibl> 149.</note>, quam misere diveximur, quod titulis caremus et <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>repugnamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum domo tua et viam domini strenue prosequere.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, 8. iunii anno 39.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Os. <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Myconius</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Nocte praecedente d. <persName ref="p5046">Grynaeus</persName> filium<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="27"><persName ref="p5046">Samuel Grynäus</persName>, 1539-1599, immatrikulierte sich 1551/52 in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, 1559 in <placeName ref="l512">Tübingen</placeName> und 1561 in <placeName ref="l1690">Dôle</placeName>. 1565 wurde er in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> zum Magister und 1569 zum Doktor beider Rechte promoviert. Ab 1571 lehrte er an der juristischen Fakultät, und 1591 wurde er zum Stadtsyndicus ernannt. - Lit.: Basel, Matrikel II 72, Nr. 21; Professoren der Universität Basel aus fünf Jahrhunderten. Bildnisse und Würdigungen, hg. v. Andreas Staehelin, Basel 1960, S. 54f.</note> accepit ab uxore<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="28"><persName ref="p5044">Katharina, geb. Lompart</persName>.</note>, quo tu <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>putas gaudio! etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> antistiti fidelissimo doctissimoque, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>fratri in <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>domino venerando suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
